OL,3,GNEWSAYusuf Nazir's family seek PM
OL,4,Ameeting to discuss care
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a five-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdied after he was sent home from A&E
OL,8,Fsay they hope to discuss what they
OL,9,Fdescribe as "system failures" with the
OL,10,Fprime minister.
OL,12,FYusuf Mahmud Nazir died at Sheffield
OL,13,FChildren's Hospital in November 2022,
OL,14,Feight days after he was first seen at
OL,15,FRotherham Hospital and discharged with
OL,16,Fantibiotics.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
